#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:1
msgid "Install FlagOS-Compressor"
msgstr "安装 FlagOS-Compressor"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:3
msgid ""
"Install FlagOS-Compressor before running inspection, conversion, "
"quantization, or validation commands."
msgstr ""
"在运行检查、转换、量化或验证命令之前，"
"请先安装 FlagOS-Compressor。"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:5
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:7
msgid "Prepare the following before installing:"
msgstr "安装前请准备以下内容："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:9
msgid "Python 3.10 or later"
msgstr "Python 3.10 或更高版本"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:10
msgid ""
"enough local storage for the repository, dependencies, and generated "
"model outputs"
msgstr ""
"为仓库、依赖项和生成的模型输出预留足够的本地存储空间"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:11
msgid "a PyTorch installation appropriate for your target backend"
msgstr "与目标后端匹配的 PyTorch 安装"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:12
msgid "Git, if you install from a repository checkout"
msgstr "如果从仓库检出安装，则需要 Git"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:14
msgid "Install from a source checkout"
msgstr "从源码检出安装"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:16
msgid ""
"Use a source checkout when you need editable code, documentation updates,"
" or a pinned commit."
msgstr ""
"当你需要可编辑代码、文档更新或固定提交时，"
"请使用源码检出。"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:24
msgid "Install source extras with the same optional dependency names:"
msgstr "使用相同的可选依赖名称安装源码额外依赖："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:31
msgid ""
"Use `datasets` for Hugging Face dataset-backed calibration inputs. Use "
"`official-autoround` only when you need the official AutoRound package "
"path. Native AutoRound execution does not require that package."
msgstr ""
"对于基于 Hugging Face 数据集的校准输入，请使用 `datasets`。"
"仅在需要官方 AutoRound 包路径时使用 `official-autoround`。"
"原生 AutoRound 执行不需要该包。"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:33
msgid ""
"The official AutoRound Python entry point is loaded lazily only when an "
"explicit reference or parity workflow requests it. Normal installation "
"and native FlagOS-Compressor execution do not import the optional "
"package."
msgstr ""
"官方 AutoRound Python 入口点仅在显式引用或对齐工作流请求时才会延迟加载。"
"正常安装和原生 FlagOS-Compressor 执行不会导入该可选包。"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:37
msgid "Use the main branch unless your workflow requires a pinned tag or commit:"
msgstr "除非你的工作流需要固定标签或提交，否则请使用 main 分支："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:44
msgid "Verify the installation"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:46
msgid "Check the package entry point:"
msgstr "检查包入口点："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:53
msgid "Expected result:"
msgstr "预期结果："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:55
msgid ""
"`flagos-compressor --help` lists `convert`, `quantize`, `inspect`, and "
"`validate`"
msgstr ""
"`flagos-compressor --help` 列出 `convert`、`quantize`、`inspect` 和 "
"`validate`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:56
msgid ""
"`flagos-compressor quantize --help` lists quantization, selection, "
"calibration, GPTQ, AWQ, and AutoRound options."
msgstr ""
"`flagos-compressor quantize --help` 列出量化、选择、校准、GPTQ、AWQ 和 "
"AutoRound 选项。"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:58
msgid "If you installed from source, also record the commit:"
msgstr "如果你从源码安装，还要记录提交："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:64
msgid "Choose a backend"
msgstr "选择后端"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:66
msgid "Pass the backend explicitly in conversion and quantization commands:"
msgstr "在转换和量化命令中显式传入后端："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "Use when"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "Example"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "`cuda`"
msgstr "`cuda`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "CUDA-enabled PyTorch can see an NVIDIA GPU"
msgstr "启用 CUDA 的 PyTorch 可以检测到 NVIDIA GPU"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "`--backend cuda --device cuda:0`"
msgstr "`--backend cuda --device cuda:0`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "`cpu`"
msgstr "`cpu`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "you need a portable fallback or functional smoke test"
msgstr "你需要可移植的备用方案或功能冒烟测试"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "`--backend cpu`"
msgstr "`--backend cpu`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "`npu`, `mlu`, `musa`"
msgstr "`npu`、`mlu`、`musa`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "your PyTorch build exposes one of these extension backends"
msgstr "你的 PyTorch 构建暴露了这些扩展后端之一"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md
msgid "`--backend npu`"
msgstr "`--backend npu`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:75
msgid ""
"The CLI default backend is `cpu`. CUDA is usually the preferred "
"generation environment when available, but generated artifacts still need"
" independent validation on their runtime target."
msgstr ""
"CLI 默认后端是 `cpu`。当 CUDA 可用时，它通常是首选生成环境，"
"但生成的产物仍需在其运行时目标上独立验证。"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:78
msgid "Record version information"
msgstr "记录版本信息"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:80
msgid "Record the exact tool revision and model inputs when producing artifacts:"
msgstr "生成产物时记录准确的工具修订版本和模型输入："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:93
msgid "For a source checkout, add the commit:"
msgstr "对于源码检出，添加提交："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:99
msgid "Copy the record next to generated outputs when you need reproducibility:"
msgstr "需要可复现性时，将记录复制到生成输出旁边："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:105
msgid "Fallbacks"
msgstr "备用方案"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:107
msgid "If installation fails:"
msgstr "如果安装失败："

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:109
msgid "verify the Python version is at least 3.10"
msgstr "确认 Python 版本至少为 3.10"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:110
msgid "install a PyTorch build that matches your device backend"
msgstr "安装与你的设备后端匹配的 PyTorch 构建"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:111
msgid ""
"use `python -m pip install -e .` from the repository root for source "
"installs"
msgstr ""
"对于源码安装，请在仓库根目录运行 `python -m pip install -e .`"

#: ../../source/how-to/install.md:112
msgid "rerun `flagos-compressor --help` before attempting model processing"
msgstr "在尝试处理模型之前，重新运行 `flagos-compressor --help`"
